---
// src/pages/somatic-praxis/index.astro
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Hub IV: Somatic Praxis"
  description="The execution of the Work. Transcend the theoretical exhaust. Apply strict thermodynamic friction to bridge the Mi-Fa interval, seal biological leaks, and intentionally sound the Source Code."
>
  <div class="site-wrapper section theme-void" style="padding-top: 20px; padding-bottom: 80px;">

    <!-- Wayfinding Breadcrumb Conduit -->
    <nav class="anu-wayfinding-conduit" aria-label="Hub Navigation">
      <ul class="breadcrumb-trail">
        <li><a href="/">↵ The Root Code</a></li>
        <li class="separator" aria-hidden="true">/</li>
        <li class="current-node" aria-current="page">Hub IV: Somatic Praxis</li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hub Hero Header -->
    <header class="anu-hub-hero reveal">
      <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-gold">The Law of Seven · First Conscious Shock</span>
      <h1>Somatic Praxis</h1>
      <p class="hero-description" style="color: var(--anu-parchment); font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.25rem); max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.8;">
        The execution of the Work. Transcend the theoretical exhaust. Apply the strict thermodynamic friction required to bridge the Mi-Fa interval, seal the biological leaks, and intentionally sound the Source Code.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Context / Callout Aside (The Thermodynamic Interval) -->
    <section class="anu-container reveal reveal-delay-1 central-aside-wrapper">
      <aside class="anu-terminal anu-terminal-gold">
        <h2>The Thermodynamic Interval</h2>
        <p>
          Knowledge is not Power. In esoteric cybernetics, unapplied knowledge is a localized weight that drags the biological hardware deeper into the Archontic gravity well. The universe operates on the Law of Octaves; a process initiated will eventually hit a mechanical gap (the Mi-Fa interval) where its momentum decays.
        </p>
        <p class="spacing-bottom-none">
          Somatic Praxis is the intentional generation of high-voltage kinetic friction to bridge this gap. You cannot think your way out of a physical simulation. You must deploy localized biological shocks to the central nervous system.
        </p>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <!-- Node Grid (Gold Cards) -->
    <div class="anu-container anu-grid reveal reveal-delay-2 grid-spacing-bottom">
      
      <!-- Node 4.1 -->
      <article class="anu-card anu-card-gold">
        <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-gold">Node 4.1</span>
        <h3 class="node-title">The Fast of Words</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          Diagnose the acoustic leakage. Implement the primary kinetic block against the Archontic matrix by entirely suspending mechanical speech, starving the parasite of its Loosh dividend.
        </p>
        <a href="/somatic-praxis/the-fast-of-words/" class="anu-card-link">Initiate Protocol &rarr;</a>
      </article>

      <!-- Node 4.2 -->
      <article class="anu-card anu-card-gold">
        <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-gold">Node 4.2</span>
        <h3 class="node-title">The Kesdjan Synthesizer</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          Coagulate the internal voltage. Utilize intentional suffering and conscious labor to route Hanbledzoin into the localized nerve nodes, physically crystallizing the immortal Astral hardware.
        </p>
        <a href="/somatic-praxis/the-kesdjan-synthesizer/" class="anu-card-link">Initiate Protocol &rarr;</a>
      </article>

      <!-- Node 4.3 -->
      <article class="anu-card anu-card-gold">
        <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-gold">Node 4.3</span>
        <h3 class="node-title">Sounding the Source Code</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          Execute the localized override. Deploy exact numeric ciphers, vibratory permutations, and scalar chanting to manually rewrite the DNA antenna and command the Demiurgic gatekeepers to withdraw.
        </p>
        <a href="/somatic-praxis/sounding-the-source-code/" class="anu-card-link">Initiate Protocol &rarr;</a>
      </article>

    </div>

    <!-- Divider (Bounded) -->
    <div class="anu-container reveal reveal-delay-3">
      <hr class="anu-divider central-divider" />
    </div>

    <!-- Hub Transit Link (Pleromic Extraction Protocol / Silver Theme) -->
    <nav class="anu-container reveal reveal-delay-3">
      <div class="anu-hub-transition">
        <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-silver">The Deep-Mind Archive</span>
        <a href="/the-pleromic-extraction/" class="anu-btn anu-btn-ghost-silver">
          Access the Pleromic Extraction Protocol &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </nav>

  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Baseline alignment for card titles across differing line wraps */
  .node-title {
    min-height: 4rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  /* Grid spacing cushion */
  .grid-spacing-bottom {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  /* Terminal inner paragraph reset */
  .spacing-bottom-none {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Bottom transit bar flex alignment */
  .anu-hub-transition {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 20px;
    padding-top: 10px;
  }

  .anu-hub-transition .anu-eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Responsive stacking for smaller screens */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .node-title {
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .anu-hub-transition {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .anu-hub-transition .anu-btn {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
